<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Elec sees smaller 2nd-half chip losses.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Elec sees smaller 2nd-half chip losses.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Electric Corp expects losses from its semiconductor business to narrow in the second half of the current business year to March 31, a company spokesman told a news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>He said the company was reducing its group investment in chips for the whole of 1996/97 to 115 billion yen.</p>
<p>The company expects parent operating profit for the full year to be 55 billion yen, he said.</p>
